- workers/worker.ts: replace CORS wildcard (*) with allow-list origin
  (http://localhost:3000, https://website.vasudevaya.workers.dev,
  https://www.vantaos.org); add credentials header
- npm run lint (tsc --noEmit) now clean (0 errors) on fresh checkout
